cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "MeteoCalc: an offline meteorological calculator"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Jef
    family-names: Zerrudo
    email: jbzerrudo@alum.up.edu.ph
    alias: jbzerrudo
repository-code: "https://github.com/jbzerrudo/MeteoCalc"
url: "https://jbzerrudo.github.io/MeteoCalc/"
abstract: >-
  A single-file, offline browser calculator for meteorological conversions and
  derived quantities: wind speed units and Beaufort force, WMO tropical cyclone
  wind averaging period conversion, gust factors, TC intensity scale comparison,
  pressure-wind relationships, humidity and comfort indices, standard atmosphere
  and altimetry, and parcel thermodynamics and stability indices. Each result
  carries the published source it derives from.
keywords:
  - meteorology
  - tropical cyclone
  - psychrometrics
  - standard atmosphere
  - atmospheric thermodynamics
  - education
license: PolyForm-Noncommercial-1.0.0
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-08-23"
